{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"ac8d94365e7d0e35a6271f6bada25aaf8db368303f84b8c371b7fc3ce50491da","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP server LLM gates / attested-source snapshot resolution","key_entities":["REBAR_ROOT","MCP_CODE_DIR","REBAR_TRACKER_DIR","/app","/var/gerrit/site/mcp-code",".git",".deployed_ref","review_plan","verify_completion","review_code","reconcile","src/rebar/_snapshot/repo_snapshot.py","src/rebar/llm/gate_source.py","src/rebar/_config_resolvers.py","Dockerfile.mcp","docker-compose.yml","origin/main","repo_root_or_none()"],"problem_keywords":["ref resolution failure","git metadata missing","attested-source gates","container deployment","plan-review","completion verification","snapshot layer","configured root"],"propositions":["The deployed MCP container's working directory /app contains no .git metadata and no real git object DB, blocking all ref resolution for attested-source gate operations.","The snapshot layer defaults missing repo_root to the literal cwd '.' instead of consulting the configured REBAR_ROOT environment variable, causing gates to fail when cwd is not a repository.","Attested-source gates (review_plan, verify_completion, review_code, reconcile) require a provisioned code repository clone at REBAR_ROOT and the snapshot layer must honor that configuration.","Local-source verdicts bypass the ref resolution defect but are never signed, making them insufficient to satisfy gate requirements or close tasks.","The fix requires both provisioning a real git clone at /var/gerrit/site/mcp-code with blob:none filtering and updating the snapshot layer's _resolved_root() to consult configured roots before defaulting to cwd."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787910445554979001,"uuid":"4c2eda56-36c4-472c-b7f3-0881faa142ba"}